    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/439b92b595e102b8a6a1bb477577ca0a.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: The demo version supports English and Korean. The full version will support 15 languages.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nobody Woods: Lucy</strong> is the story of a boy named Lucy who has fallen into the mysterious forest of Nobody Woods.<br>Escape looming threats and meet strange new friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/b1ebe9d4730d077b8d6e1b5379b40eb9.poster.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/b1ebe9d4730d077b8d6e1b5379b40eb9.webm?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/b1ebe9d4730d077b8d6e1b5379b40eb9.mp4?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven horror adventure blending cruelty with dark comedy<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/2b9c971709e37b1042a54a1d78571fab.poster.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/2b9c971709e37b1042a54a1d78571fab.webm?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/2b9c971709e37b1042a54a1d78571fab.mp4?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique art style and immersive visual storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/63a8c56d457d64c385fa5893dfa497a4.poster.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/63a8c56d457d64c385fa5893dfa497a4.webm?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/63a8c56d457d64c385fa5893dfa497a4.mp4?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive 3D point-and-click exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/736be888c037b792e03d5eb88c2a8d52.poster.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/736be888c037b792e03d5eb88c2a8d52.webm?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/736be888c037b792e03d5eb88c2a8d52.mp4?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter of the <i>Nobody Woods</i> series</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/0a1f8bca099fac8cd6b594a4585c2499.poster.avif?t=1755137701\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/0a1f8bca099fac8cd6b594a4585c2499.webm?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613510/extras/0a1f8bca099fac8cd6b594a4585c2499.mp4?t=1755137701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nobody Woods: Lucy</i> is being developed with passion and care.<br>Add it to your wishlist and follow the page to show your support!</p>",
